oll VR:<br><br><strong>Swipe</strong><br>Recommended for &quot;Easy&quot; and &quot;Normal&quot; difficulty levels, this option allows you to guide the ball by sliding the VR controller in the direction you want to go.<br><br><strong>Touchpad</strong><br>Recommended for &quot;Hard&quot; and &quot;Insane&quot; difficulty levels, you can guide the ball using the Touchpad on the VR controller.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Competition</strong></h2><br>See how your total points earned rank among all players. If you're not among the best, there's no need to get down. Try to get a better score by replaying the levels you've already played. Of course, if you haven't played all the levels, finish them first and get closer to your maximum limit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Balls</strong></h2><br>As you finish levels, you'll gain energy to unlock and play with different types of balls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204210/extras/587b6153aaa7d75f31938c5247e93c29.poster.avif?t=1763473888\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204210/extras/587b6153aaa7d75f31938c5247e93c29.webm?t=1763473888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204210/extras/587b6153aaa7d75f31938c5247e93c29.mp4?t=1763473888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Such a Universe for Such Music!</strong></h2><br>Experience completely different neon universes with the dynamic universe system that changes according to different music genres!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Electronic<br></li><li>Rock<br></li><li>Metal<br></li><li>Classic</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap